        open_sync                           161.672 ops/sec    6185 usecs/op

Compare file sync methods using two 8kB writes:
(in "wal_sync_method" preference order, except fdatasync is Linux's default)
        open_datasync                       115.407 ops/sec    8665 usecs/op
        fdatasync                           562.288 ops/sec    1778 usecs/op
        fsync                               162.573 ops/sec    6151 usecs/op
